comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-13T09:19:45.661Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: full 2755-item all-status export and request-specific CLI searches found historical dependency refreshes but no owner for this exact version set. Registry timestamps predate the normal release-age window. Vitest 5 and TypeScript 7 remain incompatible with current peer contracts; npm-package-arg 14 exceeds the supported Node 22 floor. These retain their canonical open owners."
  "2026-09-13T09:31:04.575Z","harness:codex","Updated YAML to 2.9.1, fast-check to 4.10.0, and development Node declarations to 26.5.1. Reviewed generated manifest and lockfile diff; retained published @types/node >=22 and Node >=22.18.0 support. Linked typecheck passed; pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities across 373 resolved dependencies. Major migrations remain owned by existing compatibility items."
  "2026-09-13T09:46:00.917Z","harness:codex","Final source verification: all 683 test files and 8808 tests passed. Exact all-source coverage is 100/100/100/100: statements 64355/64355, branches 49089/49089, functions 13372/13372, lines 61640/61640. No thresholds or exclusions were weakened. Static code, documentation, duplicate, contract, SDK surface, and performance checks passed; the initial graph prose-reference failure was corrected with typed relationships, then graph and record-integrity assurance passed. Packed consumer and hosted review evidence remain pending."
  "2026-09-13T09:49:53.272Z","harness:codex","Final local acceptance passed: context evaluation and 57 token surfaces; npx/bunx packed package smoke; separate npm and Bun tarball consumers exercising SDK canonicalization, initialization, mutations, six-line TOON, and full JSON; package-first authoring dogfood; compatibility migration with health and validation true. Reviewed delivery closure captures implementation and local verification; GitHub checks, bot review, merge, and publication are separate pending claims."
